# Private strings that must never reach the public repo.
# Copy to <repo>/hub/local.denylist on the hub (git-ignored, not synced), and
# to the same place in any checkout you publish from.
# One fixed string per line, matched case-insensitively. Blank lines and
# lines starting with # are ignored. Examples of what belongs here:
#   <the hub container's ID, written the way it appears in notes>
#   <NAS pool / dataset names>
#   <LAN subnet prefix>
#   <tailnet name>
